        "TileImage": "$($repository 29f32abf-80a4-4807-9818-5171d14f19c7).Image",
        "Description": "47, good job in Berlin. Our agents are tracking down the remaining Infected and stopping them. Now, it&apos;s time for you to shift your focus to the Curator. From agent Banner&apos;s databank, we confirmed that the Curator is the one responsible for the &quot;SABEN-21q&quot; super-virus. We tracked some of the Curator&apos;s informants down to the Himmapan Hotel in Bangkok. Mookjai, Barret, and Santoro are the Curator&apos;s &quot;Three&quot;. Remove the Three from the playing field, as well as an infected hostage, Toby Hicks.",
